* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary

# Fork-specific: drop upstream CI configuration on merge.
# `self-hosted` keeps these paths deleted; upstream changes to them
# resolve to "ours" (i.e. our deletion) instead of triggering a conflict.
# Requires the `ours` merge driver, which is built into git.
.github/workflows/** merge=ours